OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers
OL,6,Foccasional early evening, becoming
OL,7,Fconfined to northern and western
OL,8,Fdistricts late evening. Cloud
OL,9,Fincreasing overnight with patchy rain
OL,10,Fdeveloping by dawn. Southerly winds
OL,11,Fstrengthening with Hebridean gales
OL,12,Fdeveloping.
OL,13,
OL,14,CWednesday:FGales developing, perhaps
OL,15,Ftouching storm force over the Outer
OL,16,FHebrides. Rather cloudy with patchy
OL,17,Frain for much of the day, which turns
OL,18,Fmore persistent and heavier from late
OL,19,Fafternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
